          "componentAttributes" : {
            "richTextValue" : "<h1><strong style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Contact Intel</strong></h1><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(23, 43, 77);\">If you are unable to reach your Intel sales rep, you may direct 'how do I' and process-related questions to the Tenders IQR Team by emailing </span><a href=\"mailto:intelquoterequest@intel.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 82, 204);\"><ins>intelquoterequest@intel.com</ins></a><a href=\"mailto:intelquoterequest@intel.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 82, 204); font-size: 12px;\"><strong><ins><img src=\"https://jira.devtools.intel.com/images/icons/mail_small.gif\" alt=\"\" height=\"12\" width=\"13\"></ins></strong></a><span style=\"color: rgb(23, 43, 77);\">. If you are experiencing a technical issue, such as getting an unexplained error, you may submit a ticket by going to&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://intelinside.intel.com/support?appgroup=IQR\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 82, 204); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">https://intelinside.intel.com/support?appgroup=IQR</a></p><p><strong style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">&nbsp;</strong></p>"
